beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.diffraction=§eSPLIT §7Splits Entanglement Medium across six regions outside reality. The six parts leave as Entangled Region condensates, into the BEC network. One parallel, no overclock.
beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.anchors=§eANCHORS §7Each region needs its anchor fluid in its OWN socket (the red lens under its blade): I molten Space, II molten SpaceTime, III molten Time, IV molten Eternity, V Superdense Ergomatter, VI White Hole Matter. An unanchored region yields nothing.
beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.network=§eNETWORK §7A BEC Hatch on the base ring, facing a BEC conduit, and a running Containment Field on that network. What the network cannot take waits in the controller (never voided). More than three foreign condensates clog Condensate Assembler crafts: give the regions their own network or fence them with a Condensate Diode.
beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.diffraction.auto=§eAUTOMATE §7Anchors take ME input hatches; a level emitter on each keeps them stocked. Entanglement Medium is 0 K: pipe it with cryo-proof pipes.
beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.refab=§eREASSEMBLE §7Grabs the six Entangled Regions back out of the BEC network and reassembles them: the Universal Upgrade Core, the Eye of Harmony's jump to T10.
beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.nanites=§eNANITES §7It borrows the nanites of the nearest formed, running Condensate Assembler within %s blocks (it links itself). They are never used up.
beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.steps=§eSTEPS §7Each item slot is one step. A step needs nanites of at least its tier; every tier above slows it 2x. Durations are nanite-time: more nanites, faster crafts.
beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.lockstep=§eREGIONS §7Drawn from ITS OWN BEC Hatch's network in lockstep with the progress: a short region pauses the craft, nothing is wasted. Put it on the Reality Diffraction's network. Power: its own energy hatches, only on ticks that advance.
beyondthestars.gui.reality.info.refab.auto=§eAUTOMATE §7ME input bus in, ME output bus on the cap.
